{"id":"59c214549033bde1","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-tree-on-product.md","title":"ZFC Tree On Product","display":"df-zfc-tree-on-product — ZFC Tree On Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree-on-product","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree-on-product"],"display":"df-zfc-tree-on-product — ZFC Tree On Product","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product]]","[[58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator]]","[[58-df-omega]]","[[58-df-finite-sequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree-on-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree-on-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree-on-product — ZFC Tree On Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"925588f7d7cb9abb\" href=\"?note=925588f7d7cb9abb\" title=\"58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product\">58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"99a7a09e1b39c781\" href=\"?note=99a7a09e1b39c781\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator\">58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,X,Y,D\\in V\">\\(T,X,Y,D\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (finite-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinSeqSet}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{FinSeqSet}:V\\to V\\)</span> (bounded finite-sequence collection defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TreeOnProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TreeOnProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}on\\text{-}product\\text{-}finite\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FinSeqSet}(D)\\coloneqq\n\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times D):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,D)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}on\\text{-}product\\text{-}finite\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FinSeqSet}(D)\\coloneqq\n\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times D):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,D)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}on\\text{-}product} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{TreeOnProduct}_S(T,X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\operatorname{FinSeqSet}(X\\times Y)\n\\land\n\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall t\\in\\operatorname{FinSeqSet}(X\\times Y)\\;\n\\bigl(t\\subseteq s\\to t\\in T\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}on\\text{-}product} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{TreeOnProduct}_S(T,X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\operatorname{FinSeqSet}(X\\times Y)\n\\land\n\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall t\\in\\operatorname{FinSeqSet}(X\\times Y)\\;\n\\bigl(t\\subseteq s\\to t\\in T\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The collection of all finite sequences is bounded inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times D)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times D)\\)</span>; it is not written as an illicit set comprehension over the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Because finite sequences are function graphs with finite ordinal domains, graph inclusion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\subseteq s\">\\(t\\subseteq s\\)</span> is exactly the initial-segment relation and requires no hidden primitive <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq\">\\(\\sqsubseteq\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product","status":"resolved","id":"925588f7d7cb9abb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator","status":"resolved","id":"99a7a09e1b39c781","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2$ (finite-sequence predicate, see [[58-df-finite-sequence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,X,Y,D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FinSeqSet}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TreeOnProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}on\\text{-}product\\text{-}finite\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FinSeqSet}(D)\\coloneqq\n\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times D):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,D)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}on\\text{-}product} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{TreeOnProduct}_S(T,X,Y)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\operatorname{FinSeqSet}(X\\times Y)\n\\land\n\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall t\\in\\operatorname{FinSeqSet}(X\\times Y)\\;\n\\bigl(t\\subseteq s\\to t\\in T\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times D)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"t\\subseteq s","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqsubseteq","display":false}],"bytes":1577,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3756","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-tree-on-product.md|58-df-zfc-tree-on-product]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","925588f7d7cb9abb","99a7a09e1b39c781","5045d216c83e75cb","f4bf86f66c1444da"]}